# Buboy - 6-Chapter Core Arc (Triangle A - Character #3)
# Voice: Energetic, innocent, big-laughing Bungisngis kid whose "riddles" are forgotten errands from his Mama.
# Mainly English with light Filipino sprinkles. Zero parentheses. Zero time-of-day words. Zero em-dashes.

label Greeting
if {Transaction_HasReactiveOpener}:
	Buboy: {Transaction_ReactiveOpener}

if {Transaction_Chapter} == 0.0:
	# Chapter 1: "What Did Mama Say?"
	Buboy: Hold still, [i]Damulag[/i]! Quit licking my ear while I'm talking!
	Buboy: Hi, Kuya! Are you Lola's grandchild? I'm Buboy!
	Buboy: Mama made me repeat what to buy ten times, then a big green dragonfly flew past and I forgot it all!
	- A dragonfly wiped your memory?
		Buboy: It was super shiny, Kuya! It zoomed right past my nose!
	- Wait, you're carrying a carabao?!
		Buboy: Hehe, yeah, that's [i]Damulag[/i]! He gets lazy walking, so I just carry him!
	- Nice to meet you, Buboy.
		Buboy: Hehe, nice to meet you too, Kuya!
	Buboy: Uh oh, I really forgot the name! I still remember what the wrapper looks like though!
	- Describe it! Let's guess.
		Buboy: Yay! Okay, listen closely, Kuya!
	- Sure Mama sent you?
		Buboy: Promise, po! Well, she said I get to share it too, hehe!
	- Quick, before you forget!
		Buboy: Opo, opo, here it comes!
	jump Riddle

elif {Transaction_Chapter} == 1.0:
	# Chapter 2: "Teks Under the Acacia" (Tally Inflection #1: +1 win / 0 lose / -1 brush off)
	Buboy: Kuya, look! I won five teks cards under Kuya Kap's tree!
	Buboy: Wanna play one quick round? Maybe it'll help me remember what Mama wants!
	- Sure! One round of Teks.
		Buboy: Haha, no crying if I win! One, two, teks!
		[signal arg="minigame:teks"]
		if {Transaction_MinigameWon}:
			[signal arg="flag:buboy_teks_won=true"]
			[signal arg="flag:kap_clinic_known=true"]
			[signal arg="tally:+1"]
			[signal arg="note:Beat Buboy at Teks; he blurted out seeing Kuya Kap pocket a yellow barangay clinic slip."]
			Buboy: Whoa, you're super fast, Kuya! Even faster than Kuya Kap!
			Buboy: Back by the tree, Kuya Kap dropped a yellow paper from the clinic and hid it super quick when I looked!
		else:
			[signal arg="flag:kap_clinic_known=true"]
			[signal arg="note:Lost to Buboy at Teks; while bragging, he let slip that Kuya Kap hid a barangay clinic paper."]
			Buboy: Hehe, I won! Told you my card is lucky, Kuya Kap even blew on it!
			Buboy: He was coughing a lot though, and he hid a yellow clinic paper in his pocket when I asked!
	- Errand first, Teks next time.
		[signal arg="flag:kap_clinic_known=true"]
		[signal arg="tally:-1"]
		[signal arg="note:Buboy mentioned Kuya Kap hiding a yellow barangay clinic paper by the acacia."]
		Buboy: Aww, okay po! Next time we play for real, Kuya!
		Buboy: At least Kuya Kap always watches us play by his tree, even with that yellow clinic paper in his pocket.
	if {Flag_KapSubCandy}:
		Buboy: Oh, and he smells like sweet candy now instead of smoke! Did you give him some, Kuya?
	Buboy: Wait, I remembered what Mama's errand looks like! Listen, po:
	jump Riddle

elif {Transaction_Chapter} == 2.0:
	# Chapter 3: "Secret Adobo" (Tally Inflection #2: +1 keep secret / 0 paper joke / -1 threaten to snitch)
	Buboy: Psst, Kuya! Can I tell you a secret? Mama didn't send me this time!
	Buboy: Manang Ana's kids wrote a list on my hand, except I got sweaty running here so now it's all blurry!
	Buboy: Oops! Don't tell Manang Ana they're practicing adobo to surprise her, okay?!
	- My lips are sealed, Buboy.
		[signal arg="tally:+1"]
		[signal arg="note:Promised to keep quiet about Buboy buying secret adobo ingredients for Manang Ana's teens."]
		Buboy: Hehe, thanks, Kuya! They promised I get the first bite if they don't burn it!
	- What if I tell Manang Ana?
		[signal arg="tally:-1"]
		[signal arg="note:Threatened to tell Manang Ana about her teens' secret cooking run."]
		Buboy: Nooo, please don't! I'll give you two shiny teks cards, just keep it secret!
	- Why didn't they use paper?
		Buboy: They did, Kuya! I turned it into a paper airplane and it got stuck on a roof, hehe!
	Buboy: Wait, I can still read the ink near my thumb! Here's what they need:
	jump Riddle

elif {Transaction_Chapter} == 3.0:
	# Chapter 4: "Don't Get Distracted" (Tally Inflection #3: +2 candy sub / +1 encourage / 0 strict / -1 doubt)
	Buboy: Kuya! I'm back for the second half of Manang Ana's surprise!
	Buboy: I walked super slow this time so I wouldn't chase any puppies or butterflies along the road.
	Buboy: I really wanna get this whole errand right so Manang Ana's kids let me help again!
	- You're doing great, Buboy.
		[signal arg="flag:buboy_trusted_errand=true"]
		[signal arg="tally:+1"]
		[signal arg="note:Cheered Buboy on during his big secret errand so he could deliver the ingredients safely."]
		Buboy: Hehe, really?! Okay, I'll hold the bag with both hands all the way home! Listen, po:
		jump Riddle
	- [Give him candy for the walk.]
		[signal arg="allow_sub_cat:candy"]
		[signal arg="flag:buboy_trusted_errand=true"]
		Buboy: Huh, Kuya? Why are you looking at the candy jars? I'm supposed to buy cooking stuff!
		[end_timeline]
	- Stay focused! No butterflies.
		[signal arg="flag:buboy_trusted_errand=true"]
		[signal arg="note:Kept Buboy focused so he could finish the secret errand for Manang Ana's teens."]
		Buboy: Opo! Straight home, zero butterflies! Here's what they asked for:
		jump Riddle
	- Bet a puppy distracts you.
		[signal arg="tally:-1"]
		Buboy: Hey, no way, Kuya! Watch me walk straight to their gate! Here's the clue:
		jump Riddle

elif {Transaction_Chapter} == 4.0:
	# Chapter 5: "The Surprise Worked" (0 tallies - pure Double Triangle A Callback)
	if {Flag_BuboyTrustedErrand}:
		Buboy: Kuya, it worked! Manang Ana's kids cooked the adobo and she flew right over our roof laughing!
		Buboy: They even gave me a huge chicken leg because I didn't drop the bag!
	else:
		Buboy: Kuya, Manang Ana's kids still cooked their surprise adobo, even if I got a little lost on the way!
	if {Flag_KapSubCandy}:
		Buboy: Oh, and guess what! I saw Kuya Kap hiding behind his tree eating candy like a little kid!
		- Keep his secret, Buboy!
			Buboy: Hehe, I won't tell! He even gave me one piece so I'd stay quiet!
		- Better than smoke, right?
			Buboy: Way better! Even [i]Damulag[/i] stopped sneezing when we walk past his tree!
	else:
		- Back to Mama's errands now?
			Buboy: Yup! Still forgot the name halfway here though, hehe!
		- Bring a paper list this time?
			Buboy: Couldn't find a pencil, Kuya, so I used my brain again!
	Buboy: Anyway, help me guess what Mama wants, po! Here's how it looks:
	jump Riddle

elif {Transaction_Chapter} == 5.0:
	# Chapter 6: "Best Helper on the Road" (Accumulated Tally Resolution -> >= 3 trusted_runner | >= 1 teks_buddy | <= 0 still_goofing)
	if {Flag_BuboyTrustedErrand} and {Transaction_Tally} >= 3:
		[signal arg="outcome:trusted_runner"]
		[signal arg="note:Became a proud neighborhood helper and promised to vouch for the shop when Reyna Mayari visits."]
		Buboy: Guess what, Kuya! Mama sent me for three things and I remembered two whole ones all by myself!
		Buboy: Oh, and Kuya Kap told me a Moon Queen comes by to check your big notebook.
		- Aren't you scared of her?
			Buboy: A little bit, po! That's why I'm bringing [i]Damulag[/i] with me!
		- Two out of three is awesome!
			Buboy: Hehe, I'm basically a grown-up helper now, right Kuya?
		Buboy: When that Moon Queen comes, call me! I'll tell her your store is the best one in Karimlan!
		Buboy: Okay, help me guess that last third thing Mama asked for, po:
	elif {Transaction_Tally} >= 1:
		[signal arg="outcome:teks_buddy"]
		[signal arg="note:Stayed a cheerful Teks rival who still forgets half his Mama's list."]
		Buboy: Kuya! Nobody on the road can beat me at Teks except you!
		Buboy: Mama says I'm way faster at errands now too, mostly because you always know what I'm describing!
		- Happy to help, Buboy.
			Buboy: Hehe, thanks, Kuya! If that Moon Queen ever visits, [i]Damulag[/i] and I will cheer for you!
		- Teks rematch anytime!
			Buboy: Deal! Right after I bring this home to Mama!
		Buboy: Okay, listen to this clue, po:
	else:
		[signal arg="outcome:still_goofing"]
		[signal arg="note:Still zooming up and down the road forgetting errands."]
		Buboy: Hi, Kuya! I chased a blue butterfly two streets over and forgot what Mama wanted again, hehe!
		- What does it look like?
			Buboy: Wait, let me think! Oh, I got it!
		- Classic Buboy.
			Buboy: Hey, at least I didn't drop the coins this time, po!
		Buboy: Here's what I remember, Kuya:
	jump Riddle

label Riddle
# Crisp 2-line forgotten-errand descriptions by {Transaction_ItemWantsID} (never spoils the item name!)
if {Transaction_ItemWantsID} == "argentita":
	Buboy: The heavy round tin with red meat and a bright sun right on the label, po!
	Buboy: Mama cranks it open with that spinning wheel until it goes rrrrrk, smells awesome with onions!
elif {Transaction_ItemWantsID} == "cenchuree":
	Buboy: The super flat round tin, po, not the tall one, the really squished flat one!
	Buboy: Smells just like the fish stalls at the market when Mama spreads it on bread!
elif {Transaction_ItemWantsID} == "scam":
	Buboy: The blocky rectangle can with the pink meat tucked inside, Kuya!
	Buboy: Mama slices it flat and fries it until all the corners get super crispy, hehe!
elif {Transaction_ItemWantsID} == "lucky9":
	Buboy: The meat can with a big lucky number printed right on the front, po!
	Buboy: Bigger than eight and smaller than ten! Hehe, bet you got that one, Kuya!
elif {Transaction_ItemWantsID} == "mema":
	Buboy: The fish can swimming in red tomato sauce that Mama pours over hot soup!
	Buboy: Asked Mama to repeat the name and she just yelled to grab the number-one tin, hehe!
elif {Transaction_ItemWantsID} == "anoba":
	Buboy: Those thin crunchy crackers stacked up neat like a tiny house roof, po!
	Buboy: Dropped a pack on the road once and smashed every piece, still ate all the crumbs though, hehe!
elif {Transaction_ItemWantsID} == "patos":
	Buboy: The bright yellow chip bag that sounds like a duck on the farm, quack quack!
	Buboy: Turns all ten of your fingers super yellow with cheese dust so you have to lick them clean!
elif {Transaction_ItemWantsID} == "dantes":
	Buboy: The noisy snack bag full of mixed nuts and crunchy bits that goes tatatatata when you shake it!
	Buboy: Mama says the name sounds just like that handsome actor on TV!
elif {Transaction_ItemWantsID} == "marites":
	Buboy: The super loud crunchy snack that the whole street hears the second you bite one!
	Buboy: Mama always laughs because it's named after aunties who gossip by the gate, hehe!
elif {Transaction_ItemWantsID} == "ngaragya":
	Buboy: Those round crunchy cracker nuts in a small bag, Kuya!
	Buboy: The second you tear it open, the whole room smells just like Mama's adobo!
elif {Transaction_ItemWantsID} == "utang":
	Buboy: The green crunchy ring snack with a farmer's salakot hat and a tiny vinegar bowl on front!
	Buboy: Mama laughs at the name because it's the exact word written inside your loan lista, hehe!
elif {Transaction_ItemWantsID} == "champyon":
	Buboy: That box of white smoke sticks Papa sends me for, though Mama says I'm never allowed to touch them!
	Buboy: Sounds just like winning a first-place gold medal in a game, po!
elif {Transaction_ItemWantsID} == "marboro":
	Buboy: The bright red box of grown-up smoke sticks, Kuya, definitely not the blue one!
	Buboy: Papa made me swear twice to get the red pack that looks all royal on front!
elif {Transaction_ItemWantsID} == "mayti":
	Buboy: The green-and-white smoke box with the big red letter stamped on the front, po!
	Buboy: Papa says it feels cold like toothpaste in your throat, grown-ups are so weird, hehe!
elif {Transaction_ItemWantsID} == "coke":
	Buboy: The dark fizzy bottle that goes pshhhh when you pop the cap off, Kuya!
	Buboy: All the bubbles jump straight up my nose and make me sneeze every single sip, hehe!
elif {Transaction_ItemWantsID} == "water":
	Buboy: Just the plain clear bottle with zero color and zero taste inside, po!
	Buboy: Best thing ever after carrying [i]Damulag[/i] up and down the road!
elif {Transaction_ItemWantsID} == "gin":
	Buboy: The tall clear glass bottle that smells like rubbing alcohol for scraped knees, Kuya!
	Buboy: Papa sent me on a secret run for it, please don't tell Mama, hehe!
elif {Transaction_ItemWantsID} == "chubs":
	Buboy: Those soft colorful chewy candies shaped like tiny little pillows, po!
	Buboy: Tried saving half in my pocket for later once and ate them all in two minutes flat, hehe!
elif {Transaction_ItemWantsID} == "mentor":
	Buboy: The long roll of round flat candies you pop out one by one with your thumb!
	Buboy: Turns your whole tongue icy cold whenever you breathe in after eating one!
elif {Transaction_ItemWantsID} == "pocha":
	Buboy: That tiny sweet wrapper candy stores hand out when you're one peso short on change, po!
	Buboy: Mama told me never to shout the name out loud because it sounds like a bad word, hehe!
elif {Transaction_ItemWantsID} == "tocino":
	Buboy: That sweet pink meat from inside your cold freezer, Kuya!
	Buboy: Smells like caramelized candy in the frying pan and wakes up our whole house!
elif {Transaction_ItemWantsID} == "hotdog":
	Buboy: The pack of long red sausages from the freezer that goes on sticks with marshmallows!
	Buboy: My favorite ulam ever, especially when the skin blisters a little in the pan, hehe!
elif {Transaction_ItemWantsID} == "borgir":
	Buboy: Those flat round meat patties from your freezer that go right between bread buns!
	Buboy: Tastes just like a fast-food drive-thru even when Mama fries it at home!
elif {Transaction_ItemWantsID} == "nagets":
	Buboy: Those bite-sized frozen chicken pieces that turn golden and crunchy in oil, Kuya!
	Buboy: Bet I could eat twelve of those in one sitting, no problem, hehe!
elif {Transaction_ItemWantsID} == "aryel":
	Buboy: That super fresh-smelling laundry powder packet Mama whips into giant suds in the basin!
	Buboy: Stuck my nose right into the bubbles once and stung both my eyes, don't try that, Kuya!
elif {Transaction_ItemWantsID} == "kneestoes":
	Buboy: The little bathroom shampoo sachet that sounds just like the action song from school, po!
	Buboy: Head, shoulders, then the two parts down below! Hehe, forgot the rest of the song!
elif {Transaction_ItemWantsID} == "kopimo":
	Buboy: The small brown packet grown-ups stir into steaming hot mugs, Kuya!
	Buboy: Took one sneaky sip from Papa's cup once, super bitter, made my whole face scrunch up!
elif {Transaction_ItemWantsID} == "chicken":
	Buboy: The flat noodle pack with a hard curly brick inside and a chicken on the wrapper, po!
	Buboy: Pour hot water on it and boom, instant magic soup!
elif {Transaction_ItemWantsID} == "pantit":
	Buboy: The yellow dry-noodle pack with zero soup that you toss in soy sauce and oil!
	Buboy: Comes with a tiny sour calamansi packet inside that makes the whole kitchen smell like a party!
else:
	Buboy: Hala, it really flew clean out of my head, Kuya, I got distracted watching a kite!
	Buboy: Just guess whichever staple Mama always grabs from your shelves, po!
[end_timeline]

label Talk
Buboy: Kuya, [i]Damulag[/i] is getting wiggly in my arms! Want me to describe it again?
- Grabbing it now, Buboy!
	[end_timeline]
- Repeat the clue, please.
	Buboy: Okay, po, listen super close, ha!
	jump Riddle
- Sorry, we're out of stock.
	Buboy: Hala, all out, po?! Okay Kuya, I'll zoom back after Uncle Mario's tricycle passes through!
	[signal arg="refuse_service"]
	[end_timeline]

label Partial
set {Variation} = range(1,4).pick_random()
if {Variation} == 1.0:
	Buboy: Yes, one down! Wait Kuya, there's still more on my errand!
elif {Variation} == 2.0:
	Buboy: Salamat, po! Hold on, I still need the rest of the list!
else:
	Buboy: Hehe, nailed that one! Just the rest of my errand left, Kuya!
if {Transaction_RemainingCount} > 0:
	jump Riddle
[end_timeline]

label SubstituteItem
[signal arg="flag:buboy_trusted_errand=true"]
[signal arg="tally:+2"]
[signal arg="note:Gave Buboy {Transaction_SubstituteItemName} to cheer him on during his big neighborhood errand."]
Buboy: Hala, [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_SubstituteItemName}[/color]?! For me, Kuya, for good luck on the run?!
Buboy: You're the coolest, Kuya! Promise I won't drop a single bag all the way to Manang Ana's door!
[signal arg="story_success"]
[end_timeline]

label Satisfy
if {Transaction_StoryGouged}:
	Buboy: Hala Kuya, that wiped out all my coins, Mama's gonna ask why there's zero change!
	Buboy: Okay po, I'll just run home extra fast!
else:
	Buboy: Yes, bullseye, Kuya! Fastest team on the road, hehe!
	if {Global_TipActive}:
		Buboy: Mama said you can keep the extra peso if the price is nice, salamat po!
	Buboy: Hold on tight, [i]Damulag[/i], we're zooming home!
[signal arg="story_success"]
[end_timeline]

label WrongItem
Buboy: Hala, I don't think that's what Mama meant, Kuya! Wait, let me describe it again, ha!
jump Riddle
